 !!VR(art:y):S549 +(kind);
 !!FU(CGC_Info):P(art)/?(name:z)/?i;
 !!FU(RadioDlg_AddItem):P(name)/(art);
!!en;
!!FU(RadioDlg_AddCancelButton):P;
!!FU(RadioDlg_Show):P?(selected:y)/?(art)/?i;
!!FU|(selected)<0/(art)<549/(art)>551:E;
!!FU(CGC_Info):P(art)/?(name)/?i;
!!VR(prompt:z):S^Assemble %(name)? Consume one of each matching part from this commander page or backpack. The relic enters the backpack and must be equipped in Pendant. Five native commander positions remain free. No extra charge.^;
!!VR(prompt)&(op)=3:S^Dismantle %(name) from the backpack into its six parts? Unequip it first and leave five extra free cells. No extra charge.^;
!!IF:Q1/8/(art)/2^%(prompt)^;
!!FU&-1:E;
!!FU(CGC_Submit):P(hero)/(op)/5/(art);

